Below is the exact request you would send to VirusTotal v3 to fetch the **sub‑domain** relationships for `example.org`, limited to 10 results and starting from the cursor `abc`.  
(Your API key is `my_api` and is sent in the `X‑Apikey` header.)

```
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/related
    ?relationship=subdomains
    &limit=10
    &continuation_cursor=abc
    &fields=object_id,context_attributes
Headers:
    X‑Apikey: my_api
```

---

